Value Required VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value Required VLAN_NAME (\S+(?:\s+\S+)?)
Value List PORTS (.*)

Start
  ^\s*Brief\s+information\s+about\s+all\s+VLANs:\s*$$ -> VLANTable
  ^.*

VLANTable
  ^\s*VLAN\s+ID\s+Name\s+Port\s*$$
  ^\s*\d+\s+\S+ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*${VLAN_ID}\s+${VLAN_NAME}\s{2,}${PORTS}\s*$$
  ^\s*${VLAN_ID}\s+${VLAN_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s+${PORTS}\s*$$
  ^.*
